    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>護甲（重甲），極珍稀（需同調）</em><br />這套護甲與外表與關節處均裝有齒輪，這些齒輪彼此咬合。它自 <strong>機械境Mechanus</strong> 的秩序魔法中汲取能量。<br />這套護甲具有4發充能。穿戴盔甲期間，每當你進行一次[[/r d20]]擲骰時，你都可以消耗1發充能將你已骰出的骰值改爲10。這套護甲在每日黎明時分恢復[[/r 1d4]]發已消耗的充能數。</p><p><span style=\"font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif\">該護甲由互相鎖接的金屬環編成。鍊甲還包括在甲冑下面穿戴的一層織物襯裏，用以阻止擦傷並減緩揮擊的衝擊。此護甲同時還附有護手。</span></p><p>The outside surface and internal joints of this armor whir with interlocking gears, drawing on the orderly magic of the plane of Mechanus.</p><p>The armor has 4 charges. If you make a [[/r d20]] roll while wearing this armor, you can expend 1 charge to change the number rolled to a 10. The armor regains [[/r 1d4]] expended charges daily at dawn.</p><p>Made of interlocking metal rings, chain mail includes a layer of quilted fabric worn underneath the mail to prevent chafing and to cushion the impact of blows. The suit includes gauntlets.</p></div>",
